ole Doctorale STIC\nLaboratoire I3S\nCS 40121\n06903 Sophia Antipolis Cedex\nFrance\nSecretariat : Dana Payan\nedstic@i3s.unice.fr\nSecretariat open to doctoral students. Please contact the secretariat to arrange an appointment.\nContact doctoral student representatives:\nrepresentants-doctorants-edstic@listes.univ-cotedazur.fr\nSee also the Center for doctoral studies (maison des \u00e9tudes doctorales) of UniCA :\nCenter for doctoral studies (Maison des \u00c9coles Doctorales, MED) of UniCA\nDirector of the ED STIC : Jean-Paul Comet\nDeputy Director: Sylvie Icart\nDeputy Director: Nicolas Nisse\nDoctoral student representatives: Dalia Hareb, Margaux Schmied, Thomas Prevost\n\u00a9 2024 Tous droits r\u00e9serv\u00e9s \u00c9cole Doctorale STIC n.84 \u00a9\u2002|\nRGPD\u2002|\nMentions l\u00e9gales", "links": [["", "https://webusers.i3s.unice.fr/edstic/index-fr.php"], ["", "https://webusers.i3s.unice.fr/edstic/index-en.php"], ["connexion ADUM", "https://adum.fr/"], ["Home", "https://webusers.i3s.unice.fr/edstic/index-en.php"], ["Home", "https://webusers.i3s.unice.fr/edstic/index-en.php"], ["Overview", "https://webusers.i3s.unice.fr/edstic/1-2-presentationGenerale-en.php"], ["Scientific Board", "https://webusers.i3s.unice.fr/edstic/1-3-conseilED-en.php"], ["Students associations", "https://webusers.i3s.unice.fr/edstic/1-4-associations-en.php"], ["Laboratories", "https://webusers.i3s.unice.fr/edstic/1-5-laboratoires-en.php"], ["Members", "https://webusers.i3s.unice.fr/edstic/1-6-membres-en.php"], ["practical info", "https://webusers.i3s.unice.fr/edstic/2-2-calendrier-en.php"], ["Calendar", "https://webusers.i3s.unice.fr/edstic/2-2-calendrier-en.php"], ["Miscellaneous Documents", "https://webusers.i3s.unice.fr/edstic/2-3-documentsTelechargeables-en.php"], ["Legal Texts", "https://webusers.i3s.unice.fr/edstic/2-4-textesLegislatifs-en.php"], ["Institutional Texts", "https://webusers.i3s.unice.fr/edstic/2-5-textesEtablissements-en.php"], ["Miscellaneous", "https://webusers